  describe('Model Compatibility', () => {
    it('should work with Gemma 2b plain text output', async () => {
      // Typical Gemma 2b output format
      const gemmaOutput = `## Introduction to AI Systems

Artificial Intelligence systems have evolved significantly. They now power various applications from natural language processing to computer vision.

